  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="1">Confirm the r1 gate and 005, 007, 020, 024; read the run endpoints, 007's method and 005's store. A10: 007's RunUserUnresolved is NOT the no-systemuser outcome (notes/007-decisions.md); if the owner's 008 decision requires UserContextRequired for a no-row caller, resolve the caller's systemuser before calling AuthorizePlaybookRunAsync.</step>
    <step order="2">Write RunPlaybookTool with idempotency and McpLongRunning.Started; write GetPlaybookRunTool with McpLongRunning.Status.</step>
    <step order="3">Add ledger rows; write the contract and auth tests; run MCP suites, run tests from 005/007, ArchTests and conformance.</step>
    <step order="4">Measure the publish-size delta.</step>
    <step order="5">Update TASK-INDEX.md: change this task's status cell to `✅ [done]` (the bracketed ASCII token is mandatory, the emoji alone is not greppable: task-create Step 5, FAILURE-MODES G-16), set the POML &lt;status&gt; to completed, and run pwsh scripts/check-task-status-drift.ps1</step>
    <step order="6">If any deviations from plan, document in projects/spaarkeai-mcp-bff-api-r2/notes/ (decisions go to notes/decisions.md)</step>
  </steps>

  <escalation>
    <trigger>If the REST run-status routes have no StartedByOid check (any user can read any run), STOP and report it as a found security defect (uac-r2) before relying on them.</trigger>
    <trigger>If idempotency needs a new store, STOP and escalate with the §11 answers.</trigger>
  </escalation>

  <justification>
    <existing>PlaybookOrchestrationService and the REST run routes (PlaybookRunEndpoints.cs); 007's shared authorization; 005's PlaybookRunRecordStore; 020's McpLongRunning; legacy agent start/poll (deleted).</existing>
    <extension>All services are reused; the tools are thin adapters that compose them, as spec "Placement &amp; New Components" states.</extension>
    <cost-of-doing-nothing>Copilot users cannot run a JPS playbook or see its result (FR-05 fails), and FR-14's start/status round trip has no first user.</cost-of-doing-nothing>
  </justification>

  <tools>
    <tool name="dotnet">dotnet build; dotnet test</tool>
  </tools>

  <outputs>
    <output type="code">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/Mcp/LegalOperations/Playbooks/RunPlaybookTool.cs</output>
    <output type="code">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/Mcp/LegalOperations/Playbooks/GetPlaybookRunTool.cs</output>
